      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the transfer of five (5) New York City Department of Health clinical programs encompassing Child Health, Dental Health, Correctional Health, Communicare and Homeless Health (hereinafter the \"Programs\") to the New York City Health and Hospitals Corporation would result in more effective delivery of primary medical care services to the citizens of the City of New York; and",
